  "slug": "artist:opolopo",
  "name": "Opolopo",
  "editorial_article": "Born in Zirc, Hungary and raised in Stockholm, Sweden, Peter Major performs under the moniker Opolopo, a Yoruban term meaning \"plenty\" or \"much.\" His production work frequently navigates the intersections of funk, boogie, soul, and various shades of house. In 2022, he released the funk-oriented record X Machine, while his 2020 project You Got To Have Freedom demonstrates his commitment to deep, groove-driven arrangements. Beyond his solo output, he has collaborated with artists like Angela Johnson on the album Best Of Both Worlds, which saw release through Reel People Music. As a touring DJ, he moves between international club circuits in cities ranging from London to Tokyo, focusing on warm disco-boogie textures and rhythmic complexity.",
